cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "Does Lifting Help Fraud Detection? Code"
abstract: >-
  Code for the paper "Does Lifting Help Fraud Detection? A Higher-order Benchmark and a
  Three-regime Study of Camouflaged Fraud": it builds the fraud graphs and their
  candidate-cell substrate, trains the baselines and the learnable-lifting model, runs the
  synthetic D(mu) study and the temporal crossover, and writes the paper's tables.
